# Scripts and data files parsed/executed on the Linux VPS and CI runner must
# stay LF regardless of a contributor's local core.autocrlf setting --
# core.autocrlf=true silently turning these into CRLF broke migrate.sh on
# the VPS with "set: pipefail: invalid option name" (2026-09-21).
*.sh text eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
